<title>UK: OKB sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>OKB sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OKB - OESTERREICHISCHE KONTROLLBANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100	  COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    14.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.79    PAY DATE    14.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED  OFF EURO-SHELF PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
